    "detailed_description": "The four Winds have stopped blowing and the Dark Prince of Dremor is casting the world into darkness.  Can you the unexpected hero save the lands of Al'lysca?<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Retro Inspired 2D Pixel Graphics<br></li><li> More than 60 Hand-drawn monsters to fight. All done by artist Jari Feldt.<br></li><li> An expansive world to explore.  Including 6 different islands and a multitude of dungeons.<br></li><li> An original thematic soundtrack that changes based on environments.  Composed by Jeremy Beecher.<br></li><li> Four different classes to play.  The Warrior, The Mage, The Necromancer, and The Knight of the Wilds.<br></li><li> Dynamic Day and Night system, with different events that happen based on the time of day.<br></li><li> Epic Turn-Based Combat with different abilities for each class.<br></li><li> Watch how your attacks affect the monsters during combat.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "The four Winds have stopped blowing and the Dark Prince of Dremor is casting the world into darkness.  Can you the unexpected hero save the lands of Al'lysca?<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Retro Inspired 2D Pixel Graphics<br></li><li> More than 60 Hand-drawn monsters to fight. All done by artist Jari Feldt.<br></li><li> An expansive world to explore.  Including 6 different islands and a multitude of dungeons.<br></li><li> An original thematic soundtrack that changes based on environments.  Composed by Jeremy Beecher.<br></li><li> Four different classes to play.  The Warrior, The Mage, The Necromancer, and The Knight of the Wilds.<br></li><li> Dynamic Day and Night system, with different events that happen based on the time of day.<br></li><li> Epic Turn-Based Combat with different abilities for each class.<br></li><li> Watch how your attacks affect the monsters during combat.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The four Winds have stopped blowing and the Dark Prince of Dremor is casting the world into darkness. Can you the unexpected hero save the lands of Al'lysca?",
